    <div class="head" style="margin:0">
      <div class="eyebrow">The brief, and how it grew</div>
      <h2>Hired for a logo. Built a whole tile world around it.</h2>
      <p class="lede">The contract asked for a product name and a logo, plus advice on UX. TILO needed more than a mark: a voice on the website, a way into photo matching, results that sell, and a place to see if it works.</p>
    </div>
