      <h2>A robot you can talk to, with a tile on its mind</h2>
      <p class="lede">The icon fuses a robot head and a chat bubble into one shape, so it says "you can talk here" at a glance. Rounded edges, expressive eyes and open arms make it approachable; a tile on the antenna ties it to the store. The name sounds like a person: "Hey, ask Tilo!"</p>
